# purpose: withdrawals, and the two ways an amount can be refused.
# exercises: WITHDRAW; insufficient-funds (with balance= and requested=); non-positive-amount
#            for zero and for negative amounts, on WITHDRAW and on DEPOSIT.
OPEN alice USD
DEPOSIT alice 100
WITHDRAW alice 30
WITHDRAW alice 70
WITHDRAW alice 0.01
DEPOSIT alice 50
WITHDRAW alice 50.01
WITHDRAW alice 0
WITHDRAW alice -10
DEPOSIT alice -10
DEPOSIT alice 0.00
WITHDRAW alice 50
BALANCE alice
